WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.039 --> 00:00:03.523
A delivery truck drove down a highway.

2
00:00:03.524 --> 00:00:05.466
The driver's belly growled.

3
00:00:05.467 --> 00:00:10.096
"I'm hungry," he said. "I'll stop for lunch soon."

4
00:00:10.097 --> 00:00:14.872
Brak-ak-ak! Brak-ak-ak!

5
00:00:14.873 --> 00:00:20.051
"Is that a jackhammer?" the driver thought.

6
00:00:20.052 --> 00:00:22.694
A big crack formed in the road.

7
00:00:22.695 --> 00:00:28.478
The driver slammed on the brakes.

8
00:00:28.479 --> 00:00:31.478
A man threw open the door.

9
00:00:31.479 --> 00:00:34.088
The truck shook.

10
00:00:34.089 --> 00:00:39.099
The driver screamed. "Ahh!"

11
00:00:39.100 --> 00:00:41.759
*** It was lunchtime at Metro City Elementary

12
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:45.509
school. Roxy and her friends were in line for ice cream

13
00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:47.792
treats. Jack swung his meal card

14
00:00:47.793 --> 00:00:49.623
around. He almost hit

15
00:00:49.624 --> 00:00:52.588
Mara. "Watch out!" Mara

16
00:00:52.589 --> 00:00:55.398
said. "Sorry!" Jack

17
00:00:55.399 --> 00:00:58.762
said. "There's a new ice cream sandwich," Terrell

18
00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:02.331
said. "It has fudge in it! I'm going to try

19
00:01:02.332 --> 00:01:04.244
it." Jack's eyes went

20
00:01:04.245 --> 00:01:06.450
wide. "Me too! That sounds

21
00:01:06.451 --> 00:01:08.929
awesome!" His meal card swung in a big

22
00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:13.414
loop. Mara jumped back. "You almost hit me

23
00:01:13.415 --> 00:01:16.952
again!" Jack grinned. "Sorry

24
00:01:16.953 --> 00:01:21.920
again!" "What are you getting, Roxy?" Terrell asked. "A rocket

25
00:01:21.921 --> 00:01:25.042
pop?" Roxy chuckled. "No,

26
00:01:25.043 --> 00:01:28.436
Terrell. I'm going to try that new ice cream sandwich

27
00:01:28.437 --> 00:01:31.378
too." "I'm getting a fudge pop," Mara

28
00:01:31.379 --> 00:01:35.345
said. "That's what I always get. It's my

29
00:01:35.346 --> 00:01:38.383
favorite." "Next!" the cafeteria worker

30
00:01:38.384 --> 00:01:40.668
said. Jack was still swinging his meal

31
00:01:40.669 --> 00:01:42.679
card. He quickly reached into the

32
00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:44.509
freezer. He grabbed an ice cream.

33
00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:48.734
Then he swiped his card.

34
00:01:48.735 --> 00:01:51.719
Roxy, Mara, and Terrell got their ice cream treats.

35
00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:54.255
They returned to their table.

36
00:01:54.256 --> 00:01:57.379
Terrell took a bite of the new ice cream sandwich.

37
00:01:57.380 --> 00:02:01.153
"Whoa! This is the best!"

38
00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:06.080
Mara grinned. "We should get ice cream every day."

39
00:02:06.081 --> 00:02:08.905
Jack looked at his ice cream and groaned.

40
00:02:08.906 --> 00:02:11.660
"What's wrong?" Roxy asked.

41
00:02:11.661 --> 00:02:15.564
"I wanted that new ice cream sandwich," Jack said.

42
00:02:15.565 --> 00:02:19.570
"But I accidentally picked out an orange ice pop!"

43
00:02:19.571 --> 00:02:23.665
"That's because you weren't paying attention," Terrell said.

44
00:02:23.666 --> 00:02:26.887
"You were too busy playing with your meal card."

45
00:02:26.888 --> 00:02:31.746
Jack sighed. "I wish Rocket Girl could help me."

46
00:02:31.747 --> 00:02:33.624
Roxy rolled her eyes.

47
00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:37.441
"Rocket Girl can't help you get a new ice cream, Jack."

48
00:02:37.442 --> 00:02:39.483
"No," Jack said.

49
00:02:39.484 --> 00:02:41.879
"But maybe she can teach me to pay attention.

50
00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:43.374
She fights villains.

51
00:02:43.375 --> 00:02:46.857
She probably has to pay attention all the time."

52
00:02:46.858 --> 00:02:49.527
Roxy started to open her ice cream sandwich.

53
00:02:49.528 --> 00:02:51.393
It looked delicious!

54
00:02:51.394 --> 00:02:54.947
Suddenly her watch beeped.

55
00:02:54.948 --> 00:02:58.021
"I'll be right back!"

56
00:02:58.022 --> 00:03:01.086
She hurried out of the cafeteria.

57
00:03:01.087 --> 00:03:04.620
"Mayor Bloom," she said. "What's wrong?"

58
00:03:04.621 --> 00:03:06.917
"Rocket Girl," the mayor said.

59
00:03:06.918 --> 00:03:08.325
"We need your help.

60
00:03:08.326 --> 00:03:11.689
A delivery truck was stolen on Route 80."

61
00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:14.259
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

62
00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:18.698
"I'm on my way!"

